      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "编译器对我们的代码是动过手脚的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "编译器对我们的代码是动过手脚的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8-GSfq1kPlGRocxp-tPhl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 476.00006103515625,
      "width": 545.699951171875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bWC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 115390000,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 323461168,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770700761053,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预备：\n1. 编译器会对我们的可执行程序“动手脚”\n2. 动态库未来也是一个独立文件，跟ELF共同配合，完成执行\n3. 动态库在未来，也要加载到内存中，甚至要进行提前加载",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预备：\n1. 编译器会对我们的可执行程序“动手脚”\n2. 动态库未来也是一个独立文件，跟ELF共同配合，完成执行\n3. 动态库在未来，也要加载到内存中，甚至要进行提前加载",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
